cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "SeqTrees: sequential tree models for tabular synthetic data generation"
abstract: >-
  SeqTrees generates synthetic tabular data by factorizing a table into a
  sequence of conditional distributions, each modeled by a decision tree
  trained on the preceding variables.
